---
permalink: /search.json
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  Search index. Iterates site.documents (posts + the _pages collection)
  rather than site.pages, because this site has a collection literally named
  "pages", which would collide with Jekyll's built-in site.pages.
  Bodies are indexed in full: the whole site is only ~110 KB of text, and
  truncating hid names that appear far down the long People pages.
  site.data.static_pages adds the pre-built workshop/ and FMQT/ mini-sites,
  which are copied verbatim and so have no Jekyll document of their own.
{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- assign docs = site.documents | sort: "date" | reverse -%}
{%- for doc in docs -%}
{%- unless doc.title -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
{%- comment -%}Category archives are generated listings, not content.{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if doc.category -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if written -%},{%- endif -%}
{%- assign written = true -%}
{
"t": {{ doc.title | jsonify }},
"u": {{ doc.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
"d": {% if doc.collection == "posts" %}{{ doc.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" | jsonify }}{% else %}""{% endif %},
"c": {{ doc.categories | join: ", " | jsonify }},
"k": {{ doc.collection | jsonify }},
"b": {{ doc.content | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | strip | jsonify }}
}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- for s in site.data.static_pages -%}
{%- if written -%},{%- endif -%}
{%- assign written = true -%}
{
"t": {{ s.t | jsonify }},
"u": {{ s.u | relative_url | jsonify }},
"d": "",
"c": {{ s.k | jsonify }},
"k": "site",
"b": {{ s.b | jsonify }}
}
{%- endfor -%}
]
